{
  "info": {
    "name": "todo-service",
    "description": "To-do REST API: nginx -> Spring Cloud Gateway (JWT required) -> todo-service.\n\nRun **CRUD flow** top to bottom (or the whole collection with the Collection Runner). **Login** signs in with `userEmail` / `userPassword` and stores the JWT in `accessToken`; every request sends it as a Bearer token. Tokens expire after 10 minutes: re-run **Login** when requests start returning 401. **Create todo** stores the new id in `todoId` for the later requests. To-dos are saved with, and limited to, the logged-in user's email (`ownerEmail`).\n\n**Other users** signs up a fresh user (unique email per run; not deleted) and checks they get 404 for the main user's to-do and can't change it.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "todoId",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "isoTodoId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "userEmail",
      "value": "demo@example.com",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "userPassword",
      "value": "demo-password",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "accessToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "otherEmail",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "otherToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "CRUD flow",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "function jwtPart(token, i) {",
                  "  const b64 = token.split('.')[i].replace(/-/g, '+').replace(/_/g, '/');",
                  "  return JSON.parse(atob(b64 + '='.repeat((4 - b64.length % 4) % 4)));",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Bearer token valid for 10 minutes', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(body.token_type).to.eql('Bearer');",
                  "  pm.expect(body.expires_in).to.eql(600);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('JWT carries the email claim', () => pm.expect(jwtPart(body.access_token, 1).email).to.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get('userEmail').toLowerCase()));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', body.access_token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{userEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{userPassword}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create todo",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 Created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Returns the new todo', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(body.id).to.be.a('number');",
                  "  pm.expect(body.title).to.eql('Buy milk');",
                  "  pm.expect(body.completed).to.eql(false);",
                  "  pm.expect(body.ownerEmail).to.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get('userEmail').toLowerCase());",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('Location header points to the new todo', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('Location')).to.match(new RegExp('/api/todos/' + body.id + '$'));",
                  "});",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('todoId', body.id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/todos",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "todos"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"Buy milk\",\n  \"description\": \"2 litres, semi-skimmed\",\n  \"completed\": false\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
